@@ -0,0 +1,483 @@
+! H0 XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
+! H0 X
+! H0 X   libAtoms+QUIP: atomistic simulation library
